# Allowlist: secrets, database dumps, .git and local-data never enter the context.
**
!requirements.txt
!constraints.txt
!alembic.ini
!app/
!app/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!ops/
!ops/*.py
!ops/container/
!ops/container/Dockerfile
!ops/container/Dockerfile.dockerignore
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
